Package: yunque
Type: Package
Title: Neural-Network Building Blocks for anvl
Version: 0.0.0.9002
Date: 2026-10-21
Authors@R: c(
    person("Troy", "Hernandez", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "troy@cornball.ai",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-4248-604X")),
    person("cornball.ai", role = "cph"))
Description: Composable neural-network operations on top of the anvl
    XLA array-computing package: broadcasting arithmetic, softmax,
    layer and RMS normalization, activations, scaled dot-product
    attention, rotary position embeddings, adaLN modulation, timestep
    embeddings, linear and convolution layers, attention masks, and
    declarative safetensors weight loading with float32 upcast. The
    forge accessory for the anvil.
